==Hungarian==

===Etymology===
{{rfe|hu|Sense query: is this a causative suffix?  The semantics in {{m|hu|tiszta}} → {{m|hu|tisztáz}} and {{m|hu|só}} → {{m|hu|sóz}} suggest that it is.}}

From {{inh|hu|urj-pro|*-ta-}}. The preceding vowel, if any, is from the original [[stem]] of the root word.

===Suffix===
{{head|hu|suffix}}

# {{lb|hu|verb-forming suffix}} Appended to a [[noun]] to form a [[verb]].
#: {{m|hu|só||salt}} → {{m|hu|sóz|só'''z'''|to salt}}
# {{lb|hu|obsolete|_|noun-forming suffix}} Found in {{m|hu|igaz}}, {{m|hu|száraz}}. See the main variant {{m|hu|-sz}}.

====Usage notes====
{{U:hu:verb-z}}

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|hu|pos=verb}}

